      "description": "Need to check your cover, tweak your policy, start a claim or keep your car admin in check? The Sheilas’ Wheels app makes it simple.\n\nIt’s the savvy way to manage your car and home insurance, all in one place.\n\nCheck your details: view your policy documents in just a few taps\nMake changes: update your car policy details quickly and easily\nStart a claim: get things moving straight from the app\nRenewal reminders: stay ahead of important dates\nSecure login: use fingerprint or face ID for quick, safe access\n\nAnd there’s more. Through our partnership with Caura, the app can help you stay on top of everyday car admin too.\n\nCar tax: get timely reminders and renew in the app\nMOT and servicing: receive MOT reminders and book your MOT or service\nCity charges, roads and tolls: check exemptions and pay charges in-app\nAirport parking: pre-book parking at major UK airports\n\nSimple, secure and ready when you are.\n\nDownload the Sheilas’ Wheels app today.\n\nDisclaimer: minimum OS requirements:\n\niOS 16.0 or above\nWe’re always looking for ways to improve the app. If there’s anything you’d like to see, send your feedback to sheilaswheelssupport@caura.com",
